<title>USA: Stocker on list of Marginable OTC stocks.</title>
<headline>Stocker on list of Marginable OTC stocks.</headline>
<dateline>SALEM, N.H. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of governors of the Federal Reserve System has notified Stocker &amp; Yale Inc that its common stock has been included on the List of Marginable OTC Stocks from May 12 1997.</p>
<p>Inclusion on the list means that the security now has loan value under Regulation T, permitting brokers and dealers to make margin loans using this security as collateral.</p>
<p>Stocker &amp; Yale common stock is traded on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market under the trading symbol &quot;STKR.&quot;</p>
